    "Could not delete your account" : "Nije moguće obrisati vaš račun",
    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Sve što ste objavili odavde se briše, vaši pratioci i osobe koje pratite se otpuštaju, a svaki server koji je znao za ovaj račun dobija obavijest da ga više nema. To se ne može poništiti, i poslije ne postoji način da se išta od toga vrati — prvo napravite arhivu pomoću dugmeta Izvoz iznad ako bi vam mogla zatrebati.",
    "Your account on this server was made for Aloha Social, so it is deleted too, and you are signed out. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go." : "Vaš račun na ovom serveru napravljen je za Aloha Social, pa se i on briše, a vi se odjavljujete. Korisnička oznaka koju brišete zadržava se sat vremena kako je niko drugi ne bi mogao uzeti onog trenutka kada je pustite.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Aloha Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Vaš Nextcloud račun ostaje netaknut: ostajete prijavljeni u sve ostalo i možete odmah napraviti novi Aloha Social račun. Korisnička oznaka koju brišete zadržava se sat vremena kako je niko drugi ne bi mogao uzeti onog trenutka kada je pustite, pa novom računu treba drugačija.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Objava koja je već stigla na tuđi server briše se tako što se taj server zamoli da je obriše. Gotovo svi to urade; nijedan se na to ne može prisiliti.",
    "Delete my Aloha Social account" : "Obriši moj Aloha Social račun",
