    "Until this is on, the page is a draft only you can see. Once it is on, anybody with the link can read it without signing in — which is the point of it." : "Dok ovo nije uključeno, stranica je skica koju samo vi vidite. Kada se uključi, svako s linkom je može čitati bez prijave — u tome je i poenta.",
