    "_{count} follower_::_{count} followers_" : ["{count} pratilac","{count} pratioca","{count} pratilaca"],
    "A <link rel=\"me\"> in the page's <head> does the same, and rel=\"me noopener\" counts as well: the server looks for \"me\" among the rel words of any anchor or link on the page. The address has to be your own profile address, the one in the line above; a trailing slash or a #fragment makes no difference." : "<link rel=\"me\"> u <head> stranice radi isto, a i rel=\"me noopener\" se računa: server traži \"me\" među rel riječima bilo kojeg sidra ili linka na stranici. Adresa mora biti adresa vašeg vlastitog profila, ona u redu iznad; kosa crta na kraju ili #fragment nisu bitni.",
    "This server fetches the page itself, in the background, at most once a day per account, over http or https only, and reads the first part of it. A page it cannot reach is left unverified and asked again later, and a page that stops linking back loses its tick." : "Ovaj server sam dohvata stranicu, u pozadini, najviše jednom dnevno po računu, samo preko http ili https, i čita njen prvi dio. Stranica do koje ne može doći ostaje neverifikovana i provjerava se ponovo kasnije, a stranica koja prestane uzvraćati link gubi kvačicu.",
