    "Sound and touch" : "Zvuk i dodir",
    "Small confirmations you hear or feel. They are kept on this device only, so a laptop at work can stay quiet while your phone taps back." : "Male potvrde koje čujete ili osjetite. Čuvaju se samo na ovom uređaju, pa laptop na poslu može ostati tih dok vam telefon kucka.",
    "Right away or in a digest, and the hours to stay quiet." : "Odmah ili u sažetku, i sati tišine.",
