    "Your address will look like @{username}@{domain}. You can follow and talk with people on Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube and other services that use ActivityPub." : "Vaša adresa će izgledati kao @{username}@{domain}. Možete pratiti i razgovarati s osobama na Mastodonu, Pixelfedu, PeerTubeu i drugim servisima koji koriste ActivityPub.",
    "Create @{handle}@{host}" : "Kreiraj @{handle}@{host}",
