    "One step is left, on your old server: tell it to move your followers here. On Mastodon that is Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; enter {handle} there." : "Ostao je jedan korak, na vašem starom serveru: recite mu da preseli vaše pratioce ovdje. Na Mastodonu je to Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; tamo unesite {handle}.",
